{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55842","headline":"添撰享太庙乐章 文宗庙奏 · 张连","name":"添撰享太庙乐章 文宗庙奏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赫尔昭代，显应元亨。\n祥符史牒，德振文明。\n风调雨顺，海晏河清。\n应延大宝，千秋化成。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张连","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}